  "limits": [
    "Positive external premix operand on every recorded attention HcPre. The pinned model initializes the first premix to [1,0,0,0] and later supplies the previous FFN pre output. Zero multiplied by exceptional input or a signed zero can affect bit identity.",
    "Treat removal of the entire observed HcPre from the score and delivery path as free, including all new Y work and all deferred coefficient contention. Keep everything downstream and all other schedules fixed. Take the largest rank duration per group as a conditional upper credit at each original EP16 entry. This is not an executable saving.",
    "Both the current reader (norm then TP gather, or empty-branch service) and the later attention post/comb/FFN pre readers must be preserved. Engram updates the residual before reuse; auxiliary mean observes the unmodified entering residual. A gap without intervening same-stream tasks is accompanied by the model dependency, not treated as independence."
  ],
